- rep-onboarding: adds soleAuthorityName, operatorPagePhone (both real,
  read by rep-crisis-response, previously undisclosed the way
  entities/seedPanelPrompts/activeEngines already are).
- icp-lock: productUrl reclassified derivable -> ask (no live crawl
  exists, unlike buyerDomain/rawVoiceCorpus which do).
- voice-capture: voiceProfile reclassified derivable -> ask (same
  finding — the claimed reuse of pin-down's extraction never happens).
- send-connect: adds autoPushIcps (real, UI-collected, database-
  persisted, previously undisclosed).
- leak-map: sampleSizeMinimum's description corrected to note it has a
  real stack column; a new comment documents AGING_THRESHOLD_DAYS as a
  distinct, more severe gap with NO storage anywhere (not added as an
  entry — nothing to point one at until a schema migration exists).
- send-report: comment documents REPORT_WINDOW_DAYS the same way — real
  gap, no storage, correctly left out of the array rather than faked.
- whop-cancellation-save-offer: adds whop_save_offer_min_tenure_days /
  cooldown_days (both real, already-defaulted stack columns, no UI yet).
- whop-bridge-manager: adds whop_bridge_field_mapping (real, defaults to
  identity mapping when unset).

Typecheck: still exactly 5 pre-existing, unrelated errors. Test suite:
identical 59 pre-existing failures. Zero regressions from this pass.

